# Testing

Write code that is testable.

## Architecture

Keep business logic independent from Android framework.

Inject dependencies.

Avoid static state.

## Prefer

- small functions
- deterministic code
- pure UseCases

## Unit Testing

Business logic should be easily unit testable.

Avoid hidden dependencies.

Mock only external dependencies.

## General

Generate code that is easy to maintain and verify.